's not even mentioning solar capacity.\n\nSeriously: the future will be decided by energy. By grid expansion, energy production, and scaling. And China has a clear lead here."},"possibly_sensitive":false,"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":4018,"like_count":51,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109018642629423174","type":"quoted"}],"text":"This is the most important graph of the year. Energy will be the biggest bottleneck, there's no doubt about it.\n\nYes, computing remains a bottleneck, and demand massively exceeds supply. But far more crucial is being able to power the data centers. China is currently building 38 https://t.co/pIZHosd2ho https://t.co/2LUKxXAxpG","url":"https://x.com/kimmonismus/status/2109249568625865214"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109057000608792576"],"media_source_tweet_id":["2109057005994586244"]},"author_id":"44196397","conversation_id":"2109248013994697184","created_at":"2026-10-11T11:41:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109248013994697184"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":16,"id":"1233929232432205827","start":3,"username":"gailalfaratx"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/dVKyX6T1zI","end":66,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/gailalfaratx/status/2109057005994586244/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109057000608792576","start":43,"url":"https://t.co/dVKyX6T1zI"}]},"id":"2109248013994697184","lang":"en","possibly_sensitive":false,"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":374331,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":141},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109057005994586244","type":"retweeted"}],"text":"RT @gailalfaratx: Elon Musk is a great dad https://t.co/dVKyX6T1zI","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2109248013994697184"},{"author_id":"44196397","conversation_id":"2109245455586492900","created_at":"2026-10-11T11:31:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109245455586492900"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":14,"id":"535358285","start":3,"username":"